It builds on the work of others:

PokeDaisy  -  https://pokedaisy.com  -  https://github.com/lidor30/pokedaisy
  The game runs on PokeDaisy's libretro core (pokedaisy_gbc_libretro): mGBA
  with PokeDaisy's companion, HUD, quick menu, EXPAND and field shortcuts built
  in. Copyright (c) PokeDaisy's authors. GNU GPL v3. It is not copied into this
  repository: scripts/build_core.sh downloads a pinned revision at build time
  and builds it unchanged, except as a static library. Its own NOTICE lists
  what it bundles.
  Core/pkcore/pk_profiles_gen.c (per-game memory addresses) is generated from
  PokeDaisy's gamedata by tools/gen_profiles.py.
  Capsule is not made or endorsed by PokeDaisy's authors.

mGBA  -  https://mgba.io  -  https://github.com/mgba-emu/mgba
  The emulator inside PokeDaisy's core. Copyright (c) Jeffrey Pfau and
  contributors. Mozilla Public License 2.0. Fetched by PokeDaisy's build.

pret disassemblies  -  https://github.com/pret/pokered, https://github.com/pret/pokecrystal
  Core/pkcore/pk_gbdata_gen.c (base stats, species order, items, places of the
  Game Boy games) is generated from them by tools/gen_gbdata.py, and Core/pkcore/pk_gb.c
  follows their save layout and formulas.

PokeAPI  -  https://github.com/PokeAPI/pokeapi
